<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47436" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠοῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠοῖος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοῖος</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑῷος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the
				morning</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστήρ</span> Ion Lyr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠοῖαι σαίρεσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					53.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἠοίη</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρα</span>) <i>the morning</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν δ᾽ ἠοίην . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.447
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>toward the dawn, eastern</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠὲ πρὸς ἠοίων ἦ ἑσπερίων ἀνθρώπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					8.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς θαλάσσης ἠοίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.100
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς ἠ. τῶν
			Λιβύων</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				160
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἠοίην</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆν</span>) towards <i>the East</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				280
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠῷος</span>.)</div>
